      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the warning, i didn't know about that reye's thing. i'm just really worried about him. i look at the bottle of tylenol and it has so many different options for kids... it's kind of confusing. he's about 45 pounds. can you just tell me exactly how many ml of the liquid tylenol i should give him right now so i don't mess it up? i just want to be sure i give him the right amount to break the fever.",
