      "content": "okay, 5ml sounds fine. i'll go do that now. actually, i also have some old infant motrin in the cabinet, do you think it would be better if i gave him both at the same time? like, i could do the 5ml of tylenol and then some motrin on top of that so the fever drops faster? i just want him to feel better ASAP.",
